CM ============================================================
CM  TM-SC-NEC-002: Screwdriver Antenna — 12m Band
CM  2.4m whip, base loading coil, 4 horizontal elevated radials
CM  Frequency: 24.890–24.990 MHz (5 points, 0.025 MHz step)
CM
CM  Loading coil (series RL at base, segment 1 of GW1):
CM    R = 0.281 ohm  (Rcoil = Xant / Q, Q~380)
CM    X = 106.6 ohm  (XL required to resonate 2.4m whip on 12m)
CM
CM  Whip: 2.4m, avg radius 0.006m, 20 segments
CM  Radials: 4 x 2.4m at z=0.005m, 90 deg spacing
CM  Ground: real (Sommerfeld-Norton), eps=13, sigma=0.005
CM  Feed: 1V voltage source at GW1, seg 1
CM
CM  Tuning note: 12m band is narrow (100 kHz); SWR curve is steep.
CM  Screwdriver position critical — small motor steps have large
CM  effect on resonant frequency. Check SWR at 24.940 MHz center.
